; Etage 01 — Chrome Ascent — Level 1
; Source design spec : design/levels/etage-01-design.md (variante Positions Z corrigées)
; ADR-0011 D-2 hiérarchie canonique, ADR-0008 collision layers
; 9 rooms, 3 checkpoints, 3 secrets (AC-LVL-46 ≥ 3), onboarding anchors
; collision_layer=8  : LAYER_ENVIRONMENT (layer 4, bit 3, décimal 8)
; collision_layer=16 : LAYER_INTERACTIVE (layer 5, bit 4, décimal 16)
; collision_mask=1   : LAYER_PLAYER (layer 1, bit 0, décimal 1)
